  "slug": "buttermilk-sausage-gravy",
  "name": "Buttermilk Sausage Gravy",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This is a family recipe for buttermilk sausage gravy that tastes best if you use Farmer John\u00ae sausage and bacon drippings.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place sausages and bacon drippings in a skillet and cook over medium heat, breaking up sausage into bite-sized pieces, until golden brown, 4 to 6 minutes. Add flour, stirring constantly. Slowly add buttermilk and cook and stir until gravy has thickened, 3 to 5 minutes."
    }
  ],
